{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Days:</b> The meaning is that you ask that He prolong your life many years, to dwell in the house of HaShem to serve Him, corresponding to 'עולמים' [worlds/eternities]." "<b>And the meaning of תוסיף:</b> Like 'the fear of YHWH תוסיף days,' except that the tav is in the second person [addressed to Him]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 61, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:26.726733519Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}